      <h3>OPERATIONAL AND DEFERRED MAINTENANCE SAVINGS</h3>
      <h4>Thermal Storage</h4>
      <p>Savings associated with the elimination of the Preventive Maintenance contract for the existing 1000 ton chiller.</p>
      <p>Annual Savings = <span data-field="thermal_annual_savings_1">{{ thermal_annual_savings_1 }}</span></p>
      <p>Associated savings of the reduced life cycle cost per year of the 400 and 763 ton chillers currently on site. The thermal storage will reduce run time hours of the existing chillers, resulting in a life extension.</p>
      <p>Annual Savings = <span data-field="thermal_annual_savings_2">{{ thermal_annual_savings_2 }}</span></p>
      <p>Deferred Maintenance Savings by eliminating the need to replace the 1,000 ton chiller is as follows:</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Item</th>
            <th>Cost</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>60,000 Piping, Pumps, Valves, Insulation & Controls</td>
            <td><span data-field="deferred_maintenance_cost_1">{{ deferred_maintenance_cost_1 }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>35,700 10% General Contractor fee, includes bonds and permits</td>
            <td><span data-field="deferred_maintenance_cost_2">{{ deferred_maintenance_cost_2 }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="2">Total: <span data-field="total_deferred_maintenance_cost">{{ total_deferred_maintenance_cost }}</span> + 10 year life of agreement = <span data-field="total_deferred_maintenance_value">{{ total_deferred_maintenance_value }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tfoot>
      </table>
      <p>Annual Savings = <span data-field="thermal_annual_savings_3">{{ thermal_annual_savings_3 }}</span></p>
      <p>Chemical savings due to elimination of 1000 ton cooling tower use.</p>
      <p>Annual Savings = <span data-field="chemical_annual_savings">{{ chemical_annual_savings }}</span></p>
      <h4>Meter Consolidation</h4>
      <p>Accounting labor savings associated with the reduction of SIGECO bills from 440 to 32. The formula used is as follows:</p>
      <p>2 min./bill + 60 min./hr. X 12 mo./yr. X $12/hr. = $4.80/bill</p>
      <p>(440 - 32) bills eliminated x $4.80 per bill = <span data-field="meter_consolidation_savings">{{ meter_consolidation_savings }}</span></p>
    </div>
