      <h3>OPERATIONAL AND DEFERRED MAINTENANCE SAVINGS</h3>
      <h4>Ballast Disposal</h4>
      <p>Cost to dispose of ballasts containing Polychlorinated Biphenyl (PCB) through an EPA-approved procedure (in accordance with State and Federal environmental laws and regulations), divided by 10 years.</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Location</th>
            <th>Savings</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Science Center</td>
